### MODULE 11: MASS PRODUCTION VERIFICATION

After transferring the standard work to mass production, record actual operating results.

Capture:

- Product model and revision.
- Production line.
- Shift and date.
- Planned manpower.
- Actual manpower.
- Target cycle time.
- Actual cycle time.
- Planned output.
